# The open channel (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "The open channel"): a radio with "Call on the open channel".
# No body, no faction. A public node goes out on air to everyone within the channel's reach, as
# one line, with no name: nobody's name goes on air (the lint refuses {player}, {name} and the like
# here). Nobody is threatened on air.

conv radio.open.call_in
for radio:open
topic "Call in what you've seen."
prio world
voice plain

node start
  say A hiss, then a tired voice: "Go ahead. Keep it short. Batteries."
  > @thick "{here}'s thick with them. Go round." -> thick   if town:infection>=60
  > @quiet "{here} is quiet. For now." -> quiet   if town:infection<60
  > @nothing "Nothing. Just checking anyone's there." -> anyone

node thick public
  say "Copy. {here}, go round. Thanks, whoever you are."
  do rumour:"Someone on the open channel says {here} is thick with them. Go round."@4
  > @out "Out." -> hub

node quiet public
  say "Copy. {here} quiet. For now. Nobody believes for now, but thanks."
  do rumour:"Someone on the open channel says {here} is quiet, for now."@4
  > @out2 "Out." -> hub

node anyone
  say "Someone's always here. That's the only thing this channel's for, most nights."
  > @out3 "Out." -> hub

conv radio.open.listen
for radio:open
topic "Listen for anyone calling."
prio flavour
voice plain

node start
  say? night :: Static. A long way off, somebody counting slowly to ten, then starting again. Nobody answers them.
  say? mood:hope :: Two voices arguing about whether the cure is real. Both of them sound happier than they did last week.
  say? mood:bleak :: Static. Then a child asking if anyone has seen her dog. Then static again.
  say A woman's voice: "If you can hear this, the houses are open. Bring water if you can. Bring yourself either way."
  > @answer "Heard you. Still here." -> answered
  > @off Switch it off. -> hub

node answered public
  say A pause. Then, very quietly, from somewhere: "Good. Good. Keep being still here."
  > @out "Out." -> hub

conv radio.open.toll
for radio:open
topic "Ask the crews what the toll is."
prio flavour
voice redhand

node start
  say "Who's asking? Never mind. Toll for you is {toll}. Same as yesterday. Prices only go one way, sweetheart."
  > @haggle "Too much. Half." -> haggle
  > @fine "Fine. Out." -> hub

node haggle
  say "Half! Lads, it's asked for half. Love the nerve. Still {toll}. Come and argue at the barrier. We've chairs."
  > @out "Out." -> hub
